  PY=/scratch/venvs/tetris-py/bin/python contrib/emacs/media/record.sh
  -> green-building-emacs: 923/923 digests match the trace, 0 stalls -- PASS
  cast 81392 B, gif 300943 B (38.9 s, 790x480, 146 frames)

